---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import Closing from '../components/Closing.astro';
import Team from '../components/Team.astro';
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro';
import TimeZones from '../components/TimeZones.astro';
import scene from '../assets/images/learning-scene.svg';
import { site, link, steps } from '../config.mjs';
---
<Layout title="One child. A world of possibility.">
<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="little-star">✳</span> ONE-ON-ONE ONLINE TUITION · CLASSES 1–9</p><h1>A little guidance.<br/>A stronger grip.<br/><em>A confident child.</em></h1><p class="hero-intro">When learning feels personal, things begin to click. Thoughtful mentors, your child’s pace, and a little more “I can do this.”</p><div class="hero-actions"><Button/><a class="text-link" href={link('how-it-works/')}>See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="hero-note"><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span> Wherever you call home. Whatever their starting point.</p></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="art-top-note"><span class="status-dot"></span> BIG IDEAS BEGIN WITH LITTLE QUESTIONS</div><img src={scene.src} width="620" height="590" alt="Original illustration of a young learner exploring ideas at a desk, surrounded by maths, coding and curiosity." fetchpriority="high"/><div class="art-caption"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span> Space to ask. Time to understand.</div><div class="art-sticker"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Their pace.<br/><strong>Their possibilities.</strong></div></div></section>
<section class="trust-strip" aria-label="Our approach"><div class="wrap"><span><b aria-hidden="true">◎</b> Truly one-on-one</span><span><b aria-hidden="true">◷</b> Time-zone friendly</span><span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b> Top-institution mentors</span><span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b> Parents in the loop</span></div></section>
<section class="section wrap why-grid reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">LESS PRESSURE. MORE POSSIBILITY.</p><h2>Not lost in a class.<br/><em>Seen as a person.</em></h2><p>Sometimes a child doesn’t need more homework. They need someone to notice the moment an idea stops making sense.</p><a class="text-link" href={link('about/')}>A little about our approach <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="reason-list"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>A pace that feels right</h3><p>Pause on a tricky fraction. Explore a curious question. The lesson follows your child, not a roomful of learners.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Questions without hesitation</h3><p>No racing to keep up or worrying about asking again. Just a mentor, a learner and space to work things out.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Confidence beyond the answer</h3><p>We care about how your child thinks and feels about learning, not just the marks on the page.</p></div></article></div></section>
<section class="section programs-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">ROOM TO GROW, AT EVERY STAGE</p><h2>Small steps.<br/><em>Stronger foundations.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href={link('programs/')}>Explore our programs <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="grade-grid">{site.gradeBands.map((band, i) => <a class:list={['grade-card', `grade-${i}`, 'reveal']} href={link(`programs/#band-${i}`)}><div class="grade-top"><span>{band.label}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="growth-art" aria-hidden="true">{i === 0 ? <svg viewBox="0 0 240 130"><path d="M120 115V52m0 38C75 90 71 61 71 61s46-5 49 29m0-21c40 0 45-36 45-36s-43 1-45 36" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M76 117h88" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="183" cy="29" r="12" fill="currentColor" opacity=".3"/></svg> : i === 1 ? <svg viewBox="0 0 240 130"><path d="m52 101 60-70 76 66H52Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/><circle cx="52" cy="101" r="12" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="112" cy="31" r="18" fill="currentColor" opacity=".65"/><circle cx="188" cy="97" r="25" fill="currentColor" opacity=".35"/></svg> : <svg viewBox="0 0 240 130"><path d="M46 116V88h43V62h43V36h43V12h30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="m52 55 115-42m-20-6 20 6-11 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>}</div><h3>{band.title}</h3><p>{band.description}</p><span class="grade-focus">{band.focus}</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">FAMILIAR SUBJECTS. FRESH PERSPECTIVES.</p><h2>Find their <em>“aha!”</em></h2></div><p class="section-aside">Aligned to your child’s curriculum.<br/>{site.curricula.join(' · ')}</p></div><div class="subject-grid">{site.subjects.map((s, i) => <a class="subject-card reveal" href={link(`subjects/#subject-${i}`)}><span class="subject-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{s.symbol}</span><h3>{s.name}</h3><p>{s.line}</p><span class="subject-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="section steps-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SIMPLE START</p><h2>A message today.<br/><em>A way forward, together.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href={link('how-it-works/')}>How it works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><ol class="steps-grid">{steps.map((step, i) => <li class="reveal"><span class="step-number">0{i + 1}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p></li>)}</ol></div></section>
<section class="section wrap nri-grid reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">NEAR IN CARE. ANYWHERE IN THE WORLD.</p><h2>Your home.<br/>Your time zone.<br/><em>Their learning.</em></h2><p>School runs, work calls, dinner together. Learning should find a place in your family’s life.</p><p>For NRI families and students in any country, we discuss a routine that works across time zones, with your child’s curriculum at its heart.</p><a class="text-link" href={link('nri-families/')}>Made for families like yours <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><TimeZones/></section>
<section class="section mentors-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">GOOD MINDS. THOUGHTFUL HUMANS.</p><h2>A mentor in learning.<br/><em>Someone in their corner.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href={link('mentors/')}>Meet all our mentors <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="team-intro">Engineering students and mentors from top institutions such as IIT Madras and NSUT. A shared belief that understanding starts with a good question.</p><Team preview/></div></section>
<section class="section wrap faq-section reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CLARITY</p><h2>On a parent’s<br/><em>mind.</em></h2><p>It’s okay to have questions.<br/>That’s where we begin, too.</p><a class="text-link" href={link('faq/')}>More answers for parents <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><Faq preview/></section>
<Closing/>
</Layout>
